      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "On the live board, the section's text renders as its title chip; the chip is not a separate object. Give the title and content clear air, and repeat one deliberate gap through each group. A section keeps exactly the geometry it is given; fit_section closes one around the children already inside it, and only that section, when the region is finished. Sections do the grouping: every idea has a home, and each section is an addressable, linkable unit. Nest sections for hierarchy."
        }
